    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Feed, cuddle, and tuck them in!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your tiny desktop companions will never leave you alone! Choose your own digital pet, feed it, and form a peaceful bond. Accompanied by soothing sounds and a relaxing atmosphere, care for your adorable cat, rabbit, or hedgehog friend. In this desktop pet simulation, you can escape the hustle and bustle of daily life and take a tranquil break in your own little world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Give all your love!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the paw icon to move your mouse over your pet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647690/extras/8476aa4d7f9ec649ee7e6842f56ed94c.poster.webp?t=1752586298\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647690/extras/8476aa4d7f9ec649ee7e6842f56ed94c.webp?t=1752586298\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1138 height=640 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Pet Management!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To adopt a new pet, you\u2019ll need to buy a new home for it first.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647690/extras/14bb91e5b6acc8c6bbf271a034dfee4c.poster.webp?t=1752586298\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647690/extras/14bb91e5b6acc8c6bbf271a034dfee4c.webp?t=1752586298\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1138 height=640 /></picture></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Feed, cuddle, and tuck them in!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your tiny desktop companions will never leave you alone! Choose your own digital pet, feed it, and form a peaceful bond. Accompanied by soothing sounds and a relaxing atmosphere, care for your adorable cat, rabbit, or hedgehog friend. In this desktop pet simulation, you can escape the hustle and bustle of daily life and take a tranquil break in your own little world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Give all your love!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the paw icon to move your mouse over your pet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647690/extras/8476aa4d7f9ec649ee7e6842f56ed94c.poster.webp?t=1752586298\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647690/extras/8476aa4d7f9ec649ee7e6842f56ed94c.webp?t=1752586298\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1138 height=640 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Pet Management!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To adopt a new pet, you\u2019ll need to buy a new home for it first.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647690/extras/14bb91e5b6acc8c6bbf271a034dfee4c.poster.webp?t=1752586298\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647690/extras/14bb91e5b6acc8c6bbf271a034dfee4c.webp?t=1752586298\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1138 height=640 /></picture></span></p>",
